#. module: qing_account_fapiao_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qing_account_fapiao_connector.view_fapiao_provider_select_form
msgid ""
"A provider task keeps the approved amount and tax reserved. After "
"acceptance, query an unknown result instead of sending another invoice "
"request."
msgstr "开票任务将继续预占已批准的不含税金额和税额。服务商受理后，如结果未知，请查询原任务，不要重新申请开票。"

#. module: qing_account_fapiao_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qing_account_fapiao_connector.view_fapiao_request_form
msgid ""
"After approval, choose manual invoice recording or select an invoicing "
"provider. Requests created before structured tax snapshots remain available "
"for manual recording; recreate and approve them to use a provider."
msgstr "审核后，可选择人工回填或开票服务商。旧申请没有结构化税率快照，仍可人工回填；如需接口开票，请新建申请并重新审核。"

#. module: qing_account_fapiao_connector
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:qing_account_fapiao_connector.constraint_qing_fapiao_order_unique_qing_request
